{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"s4636c6074fcbbf3d","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-477bc35b6cb510ccac2c","text":"[開拓者]、旅が進むにつれ、列車には新しい仲間がいっぱい来ておると思わんか？","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-a2267c3d0d847a8f47b2","text":"思う！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-6e750f08348b16753a3b","text":"思う！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-3f05c7d5f7cb8729a017","text":"旅の収穫！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-7554bd69eadbcf2be706","text":"これが旅での収穫だ{F#ね}{M#な}！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2333cf1bcdb32ef7797b","text":"ああ、仲間たちとの出会いは大切にすべきじゃ！","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-84502206ec0faee8d58c","text":"素晴らしい思い出を残すために、新しい仲間がメッセージを残せるようなノートを用意したぞ","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-5d6e5c0142c5375ca0b6","text":"訪問客登録簿はカウンターに置いておく。時間がある時に見てみるといいじゃろう！","speaker":"パム"}]}
